walaupun Yoon Ga-min berpindah,

280
00:17:22.550 --> 00:17:23.780
anda tidak akan menjadi tempat pertama.

281
00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:26.700
Apa benda karut yang awak cakap ni?

282
00:17:27.260 --> 00:17:28.660
Kerana saya Yoon Ga-min nombor dua.

283
00:17:29.700 --> 00:17:30.969
anak kecik ni.

284
00:17:30.970 --> 00:17:32.930
Apa yang dia cakap, keparat!

285
00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:35.109
Ah Jun!

286
00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:37.089
Saudara, ambil kunci kereta!

287
00:17:37.090 --> 00:17:38.369
Lelaki gila itu!

288
00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:40.059
Cikgu, tunggu sebentar!

289
00:17:40.060 --> 00:17:41.209
Saya akan kembali segera.

290
00:17:41.210 --> 00:17:42.020
Ji-woo!

291
00:17:48.060 --> 00:17:48.680
Kenapa awak jadi macam ni?

292
00:17:48.681 --> 00:17:50.040
Buka pintu!

293
00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:55.060
-Ya tuhan, apa yang kita lakukan? -Apa yang kita buat?

294
00:17:56.850 --> 00:17:58.080
keparat!

295
00:17:58.860 --> 00:18:00.380
kau bangang!

296
00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:18.050
Hei, Lee Ji-woo!

297
00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:37.200
Wah, memang tak sakit pun.

298
00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:41.430
Hei, anda tidak boleh pergi dari sini walaupun anda melakukan ini.

299
00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:45.199
Hei, pemimpin itu penting, kamu pergi dahulu.

300
00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:47.249
apa? Kemudian bagaimana dengan anda?

301
00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:48.819
saya sihat.

302
00:18:48.820 --> 00:18:50.559
Jangan risau tentang saya, kamu pergi.

303
00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:52.979
Hei, lelaki gila, berhenti berlagak keren!

304
00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:55.040
Takut nak naik kereta tu kan?

305
00:18:57.570 --> 00:18:58.450
Adakah ia begitu jelas?

306
00:18:58.451 --> 00:18:59.920
Bodoh!

307
00:19:02.890 --> 00:19:04.890
Jika anda berani dipukul lagi, anda akan mati.

308
00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:06.150
Okay.

309
00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:09.750
Hei.

310
00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:12.079
Hei... awak nak pergi mana?

311
00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:13.340
Cikgu, kami pergi dulu.

312
00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:15.670
-Bagaimana dengan Little Jun? -Dia berkata dia tidak akan pergi.

313
